  "extract": "Thomas Stanley Holland is a British actor known for his work in a diverse range of genres. His accolades include a BAFTA Award as well as two Critics' Choice Awards nominations. Holland's films as a leading actor have grossed over $13.1 billion worldwide, making him one of the highest-grossing actors of all time. He was featured on the Forbes 30 Under 30 Europe list of 2019.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Thomas Stanley Holland</b> is a British actor known for his work in a diverse range of genres. His accolades include a BAFTA Award as well as two Critics' Choice Awards nominations. Holland's films as a leading actor have grossed over $13.1 billion worldwide, making him one of the highest-grossing actors of all time. He was featured on the <span><i>Forbes</i> 30 Under 30 Europe</span> list of 2019.</p>"
